{"seq":2,"slug":"qlora","title":"QLoRA 量化微调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/parameter-efficient-methods/qlora","wordCount":693,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"qlora-量化微调\">QLoRA 量化微调</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>QLoRA（Quantized LoRA）在 LoRA 的基础上引入了 4-bit 量化技术，将基础模型的权重从 16-bit 压缩到 4-bit 存储，同时在 LoRA 层使用高精度计算。这使得在单张消费级 GPU（如 RTX 4090 24GB）上微调 70B 参数的模型成为可能，大幅降低了 LLM 微调的硬件门槛。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[基础模型权重] --&gt;|4-bit NF4 量化| B[量化存储]&#10;    B --&gt;|反量化为 BF16| C[前向计算]&#10;    C --&gt; D[LoRA 适配器]&#10;    D --&gt;|BF16 精度| E[梯度计算]&#10;    E --&gt;|仅更新 LoRA| F[参数更新]&#10;    F --&gt; D\">graph TB\n    A[基础模型权重] --&gt;|4-bit NF4 量化| B[量化存储]\n    B --&gt;|反量化为 BF16| C[前向计算]\n    C --&gt; D[LoRA 适配器]\n    D --&gt;|BF16 精度| E[梯度计算]\n    E --&gt;|仅更新 LoRA| F[参数更新]\n    F --&gt; D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术要素</th>\n<th>LoRA</th>\n<th>QLoRA</th>\n<th>全量微调</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础模型精度</td>\n<td>FP16/BF16</td>\n<td>4-bit NF4</td>\n<td>FP16/BF16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可训练参数精度</td>\n<td>FP16/BF16</td>\n<td>BF16</td>\n<td>FP16/BF16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7B 显存</td>\n<td>~14 GB</td>\n<td>~6 GB</td>\n<td>~56 GB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13B 显存</td>\n<td>~26 GB</td>\n<td>~10 GB</td>\n<td>~104 GB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>70B 显存</td>\n<td>~140 GB</td>\n<td>~48 GB</td>\n<td>~560 GB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练速度</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>较慢（量化/反量化开销）</td>\n<td>最慢</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"normalfloat4-量化\">NormalFloat4 量化</h2><p>QLoRA 使用 NormalFloat4（NF4）量化格式，这是一种信息论最优的 4-bit 数据类型。NF4 基于正态分布对量化区间进行非均匀划分，使得量化误差在权重的典型分布下最小化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from transformers import BitsAndBytesConfig, AutoModelForCausalLM&#10;import torch&#10;&#10;quantization_config = BitsAndBytesConfig(&#10;    load_in_4bit=True,&#10;    bnb_4bit_quant_type=&quot;nf4&quot;,&#10;    bnb_4bit_compute_dtype=torch.bfloat16,&#10;    bnb_4bit_use_double_quant=True,&#10;)&#10;&#10;model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(&#10;    &quot;Qwen/Qwen3-32B&quot;,&#10;    quantization_config=quantization_config,&#10;    device_map=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BitsAndBytesConfig, AutoModelForCausalLM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quantization_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BitsAndBytesConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    load_in_4bit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    bnb_4bit_quant_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"nf4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    bnb_4bit_compute_dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.bfloat16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    bnb_4bit_use_double_quant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Qwen/Qwen3-32B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    quantization_config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quantization_config,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    device_map</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>双重量化（Double Quantization）是 QLoRA 的另一个关键技术——它对量化常数（scaling factors）本身进行二次量化，在 65B 参数模型上平均每个参数节省约 0.37 bits，对显存进一步压缩。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量化类型</th>\n<th>每参数比特</th>\n<th>精度损失</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FP4</td>\n<td>4 bit</td>\n<td>较大</td>\n<td>均匀分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NF4</td>\n<td>4 bit</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>正态分布优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT8</td>\n<td>8 bit</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NF4 + Double Quant</td>\n<td>~3.63 bit</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>显存最优</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"qlora-完整训练流程\">QLoRA 完整训练流程</h2><p>结合 bitsandbytes、PEFT 和 TRL 库实现 QLoRA 训练的完整流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoTokenizer, BitsAndBytesConfig, TrainingArguments&#10;from peft import LoraConfig, prepare_model_for_kbit_training, get_peft_model&#10;from trl import SFTTrainer&#10;from datasets import load_dataset&#10;import torch&#10;&#10;model_name = &quot;Qwen/Qwen3-8B&quot;&#10;tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)&#10;tokenizer.pad_token = tokenizer.eos_token&#10;&#10;bnb_config = BitsAndBytesConfig(&#10;    load_in_4bit=True,&#10;    bnb_4bit_quant_type=&quot;nf4&quot;,&#10;    bnb_4bit_compute_dtype=torch.bfloat16,&#10;    bnb_4bit_use_double_quant=True,&#10;)&#10;&#10;model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(&#10;    model_name,&#10;    quantization_config=bnb_config,&#10;    device_map=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;)&#10;&#10;model = prepare_model_for_kbit_training(model)&#10;&#10;lora_config = LoraConfig(&#10;    r=16,&#10;    lora_alpha=32,&#10;    lora_dropout=0.05,&#10;    target_modules=[&quot;q_proj&quot;, &quot;k_proj&quot;, &quot;v_proj&quot;, &quot;o_proj&quot;, &quot;gate_proj&quot;, &quot;up_proj&quot;, &quot;down_proj&quot;],&#10;    bias=&quot;none&quot;,&#10;    task_type=&quot;CAUSAL_LM&quot;,&#10;)&#10;&#10;dataset = load_dataset(&quot;json&quot;, data_files=&quot;train.jsonl&quot;, split=&quot;train&quot;)&#10;&#10;def format_chat(example):&#10;    messages = example[&quot;messages&quot;]&#10;    text = tokenizer.apply_chat_template(messages, tokenize=False, add_generation_prompt=False)&#10;    return {&quot;text&quot;: text}&#10;&#10;dataset = dataset.map(format_chat)&#10;&#10;training_args = TrainingArguments(&#10;    output_dir=&quot;./qlora-output&quot;,&#10;    num_train_epochs=3,&#10;    per_device_train_batch_size=4,&#10;    gradient_accumulation_steps=4,&#10;    learning_rate=2e-4,&#10;    warmup_ratio=0.03,&#10;    lr_scheduler_type=&quot;cosine&quot;,&#10;    bf16=True,&#10;    optim=&quot;paged_adamw_8bit&quot;,&#10;    logging_steps=10,&#10;    save_strategy=&quot;epoch&quot;,&#10;    max_grad_norm=0.3,&#10;    gradient_checkpointing=True,&#10;    gradient_checkpointing_kwargs={&quot;use_reentrant&quot;: False},&#10;)&#10;&#10;trainer = SFTTrainer(&#10;    model=model,&#10;    args=training_args,&#10;    train_dataset=dataset,&#10;    peft_config=lora_config,&#10;    max_seq_length=2048,&#10;    dataset_text_field=&quot;text&quot;,&#10;    tokenizer=tokenizer,&#10;)&#10;&#10;trainer.train()&#10;trainer.save_model(&quot;./qlora-adapter&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoTokenizer, BitsAndBytesConfig, TrainingArguments</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peft </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LoraConfig, prepare_model_for_kbit_training, get_peft_model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trl </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SFTTrainer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> datasets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"colo